0..58 Comment "// A model that reads a port at its own scope\'s `Integer`."
59..61 Comment "//"
62..138 Comment "// The port of `say` names `Integer` in the declaring source, where it names"
139..216 Comment "// the strings. This source sees the prelude\'s `Integer`. A member that gives"
217..294 Comment "// a prelude integer does not give the word that the port names, so the model"
295..309 Comment "// refuses it."
